{"id":"911b3698e7650440","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-eliminationlift.md","title":"Constructive lifting after one variable elimination","display":"thm-eliminationlift — Constructive lifting after one variable elimination","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-eliminationlift","aliases":["27-thm-eliminationlift"],"display":"thm-eliminationlift — Constructive lifting after one variable elimination","depends_on":[],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_pdf_sha256":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f","source_section":"§2.6 Theorem 2.7","source_printed_pages":"88,89","source_pdf_pages":"112,113","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-eliminationlift"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-eliminationlift</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-eliminationlift — Constructive lifting after one variable elimination"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_pdf_sha256","html":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§2.6 Theorem 2.7"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"88,89"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"112,113"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in\\{0,1\\}^{n-1}\">\\(y\\in\\{0,1\\}^{n-1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_0,f_1:\\{0,1\\}^{n-1}\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f_0,f_1:\\{0,1\\}^{n-1}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 是下节由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 构造的两个余因子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota:\\{0,1\\}^{n-1}\\times\\{0,1\\}\\to\\{0,1\\}^n\">\\(\\iota:\\{0,1\\}^{n-1}\\times\\{0,1\\}\\to\\{0,1\\}^n\\)</span> 是下式定义的坐标插入映射。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\iota(u,b)\\coloneqq u\\cup\\{(n,b)\\}\\quad(u\\in\\{0,1\\}^{n-1},\\ b\\in\\{0,1\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\iota(u,b)\\coloneqq u\\cup\\{(n,b)\\}\\quad(u\\in\\{0,1\\}^{n-1},\\ b\\in\\{0,1\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f_0\\coloneqq\\{(u,f(\\iota(u,0)))\\mid u\\in\\{0,1\\}^{n-1}\\},\\qquad f_1\\coloneqq\\{(u,f(\\iota(u,1)))\\mid u\\in\\{0,1\\}^{n-1}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f_0\\coloneqq\\{(u,f(\\iota(u,0)))\\mid u\\in\\{0,1\\}^{n-1}\\},\\qquad f_1\\coloneqq\\{(u,f(\\iota(u,1)))\\mid u\\in\\{0,1\\}^{n-1}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f_0(y)f_1(y)=0\\Rightarrow\\left(f(\\iota(y,f_0(y)))=0\\land f(\\iota(y,1-f_1(y)))=0\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f_0(y)f_1(y)=0\\Rightarrow\\left(f(\\iota(y,f_0(y)))=0\\land f(\\iota(y,1-f_1(y)))=0\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{b\\in\\{0,1\\}\\mid f(\\iota(y,b))=0\\}=\\{f_0(y),1-f_1(y)\\}\\qquad(f_0(y)f_1(y)=0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{b\\in\\{0,1\\}\\mid f(\\iota(y,b))=0\\}=\\{f_0(y),1-f_1(y)\\}\\qquad(f_0(y)f_1(y)=0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>消元后的一个解 y 不仅给出存在性，还给出两个（可能相同的）可恢复坐标。若余因子取值为 (0,0)，恢复集合为 {0,1}；为 (0,1) 时为 {0}；为 (1,0) 时为 {1}。这逐项核对原书 Theorem 2.7，并补出完整纤维描述；n=1 时 y 是唯一空元组，仍适用。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"y\\in\\{0,1\\}^{n-1}","display":false},{"tex":"f_0,f_1:\\{0,1\\}^{n-1}\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota:\\{0,1\\}^{n-1}\\times\\{0,1\\}\\to\\{0,1\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota(u,b)\\coloneqq u\\cup\\{(n,b)\\}\\quad(u\\in\\{0,1\\}^{n-1},\\ b\\in\\{0,1\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"f_0\\coloneqq\\{(u,f(\\iota(u,0)))\\mid u\\in\\{0,1\\}^{n-1}\\},\\qquad f_1\\coloneqq\\{(u,f(\\iota(u,1)))\\mid u\\in\\{0,1\\}^{n-1}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"f_0(y)f_1(y)=0\\Rightarrow\\left(f(\\iota(y,f_0(y)))=0\\land f(\\iota(y,1-f_1(y)))=0\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\{b\\in\\{0,1\\}\\mid f(\\iota(y,b))=0\\}=\\{f_0(y),1-f_1(y)\\}\\qquad(f_0(y)f_1(y)=0).","display":true}],"bytes":1783,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-eliminationlift|thm-eliminationlift — Constructive lifting after one variable elimination]]"}],"outgoing":[]}